  "title": "5 August 1963: Live: Abbotsfield Park, Urmston",
  "date": "1963-08-05",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>The Beatles topped a four-act bill at the annual bank holiday Urmston Show, held in Abbotsfield Park in Urmston, Lancashire, on 5 August 1963. <span id=\"more-3867\"></span></p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1963-photos/630805_urmston_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-110147\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"110147\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1963-photos/630805_urmston_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"734,960\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"5\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon and Ringo Starr, Abbotsfield Park, Urmston, 5 August 1963\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_01.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/630805_urmston_01.jpg\" alt=\"John Lennon and Ringo Starr, Abbotsfield Park, Urmston, 5 August 1963\" width=\"734\" height=\"960\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-110147\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_01.jpg 734w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_01-443x580.jpg 443w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_01-153x200.jpg 153w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 734px) 100vw, 734px\"></a></p><p>They performed in a marquee in the park. Also on the bill were The Dennisons and Brian Poole And The Tremeloes, and the compère was disc jockey David Hamilton.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1963-photos/63-summer-itinerary_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-108881\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MDQiIGhlaWdodD0iOTYwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNjA0IDk2MCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"108881\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1963-photos/63-summer-itinerary_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/63-summer-itinerary_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1207,1917\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; summer 1963 itinerary\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/63-summer-itinerary_01-604x960.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/63-summer-itinerary_01-604x960.jpg\" alt=\"The Beatles' summer 1963 itinerary\" width=\"604\" height=\"960\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-108881\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/63-summer-itinerary_01-604x960.jpg 604w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/63-summer-itinerary_01-365x580.jpg 365w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/63-summer-itinerary_01-126x200.jpg 126w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/63-summer-itinerary_01-768x1220.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/63-summer-itinerary_01-967x1536.jpg 967w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/63-summer-itinerary_01.jpg 1207w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 604px) 100vw, 604px\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1963-photos/630805_urmston_02/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-110148\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1NjQiIGhlaWdodD0iNzY4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNTY0IDc2OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"110148\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1963-photos/630805_urmston_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"564,768\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney, George Harrison, and Ringo Starr, Abbotsfield Park, Urmston, 5 August 1963\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_02.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/630805_urmston_02.jpg\" alt=\"Paul McCartney, George Harrison, and Ringo Starr, Abbotsfield Park, Urmston, 5 August 1963\" width=\"564\" height=\"768\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-110148\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_02.jpg 564w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_02-426x580.jpg 426w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_02-147x200.jpg 147w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 564px) 100vw, 564px\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/gallery/live/630805_urmston_03/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-110149\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMjMxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjgxNyIgdmlld0JveD0iMCAwIDEyMzEgODE3Ij48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwJSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxMDAlIiBmaWxsPSIjY2ZkNGRiIi8+PC9zdmc+\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"110149\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/630805_urmston_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1231,817\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Ticket for The Beatles at Abbotsfield Park, Urmston, 5 August 1963\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_03-960x637.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/630805_urmston_03.jpg\" alt=\"Ticket for The Beatles at Abbotsfield Park, Urmston, 5 August 1963\" width=\"1231\" height=\"817\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-110149\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_03.jpg 1231w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_03-580x385.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_03-960x637.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_03-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630805_urmston_03-768x510.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1231px) 100vw, 1231px\"></a></p>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size